<div  data-history-node-id="7517" about="/fia/about-fia-membership" class="entity--type-node node node--type-landing-page node--view-mode-full">
  


  <div class="brand-element">
    <div class="landing-hero">
      <div class="hero-banner with-bg-img is-cta-block">
                <div class="hero-bg" style="background-image:url('/sites/default/files/2026-06/Hero_About-FIA_1900x600px_0.jpg')">
          <span class="overlay-bg remove-fade" style="opacity: calc(0/100)"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="inner-hero-content">
                    <h1 class="white-color" style="color:#ffffff; "><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">About FIA Membership</span>
</h1>
                    <h4 style="color:#ffffff;">As the leading global trade association for the cleared derivatives industry, FIA and its members work together to support open, transparent and competitive markets.</h4>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<h5 style="color:#ffffff;">To ensure access to all resources available to FIA members, <a href="https://portal.fia.org/login.aspx" style="color:#ffffff; "><strong>please log in</strong></a>.</h5>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

                  </div>
      </div>

          </div>
  </div>

  
      <div class="clearfix after-content">
      <div class="mq-relatedcontent">
        
<div class="field field--name-field-components field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden">


  <div>
          <div class="field__item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--text-block paragraph--view-mode--default component-padding">
<div class="component-padding">
  <div class="container field--type-text-with-summary">
    
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>FIA’s membership encompasses the ecosystem of futures, options and cleared derivatives markets, including participants providing clearing and execution services as well as trading venues, clearinghouses, trading firms, commodity firms, buy-side firms, technology firms, law firms and other professional service providers.</p>

<p>Our membership is global and corporate, and it renews annually. All employees within a member firm may access the member benefits we provide.</p>

<p>FIA’s members are designated as either primary or associate. Primary members are client clearing firms holding customer funds and contributing to CCP default funds.&nbsp; Associate members comprise all other firms in the cleared derivatives ecosystem.</p>

<p>Learn more about <a href="https://www.fia.org/fia/articles/join-fia">how to join FIA</a>.</p>

<p>If you would like to discuss becoming a member, or your current membership, please contact Myriam Condon:&nbsp;<a href="mcondon@fia.org">mcondon@fia.org</a>.</p>

<p style><a href="https://www.fia.org/fia/articles/join-fia" style="display: inline-block; width: 160px; height: 40px; line-height: 40px; text-align: center; background-color: #00a4e7; color: #fff; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14pt; text-decoration: none;">JOIN FIA</a></p>
</div>
      
  </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
          <div class="field__item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type--content-grid paragraph--view-mode--default component-padding">
  <div class="component-padding">
    <div class="container">
