          <div class="field__item"><div class="container component-padding component-two-column-listing">
  <h2>FIA New Members</h2>
  	    
                                              
                    <div class="views-element-container"><div class="view view-news-article-resources-by-keyword view-id-news_article_resources_by_keyword view-display-id-two_column_listing_block js-view-dom-id-e70cc73f1d413c589f26b61d75e7d10a21d8afdf975b2a3e61dbcc7acc3d4b13">
  
    
      
      <div class="view-content">
      <div class="component listing">
  
  <ul class="row no-list-style show-more-items">

          <li class="col-lg-6">
        

<div class="field-content">
  <div class="promo-block half-promo ">
    <div class="promo-content">
              <span class="meta-data darker-gray-color">07 Oct 2026 </span>
            <h4>FIA New Member – Centalion</h4>
            <div class="promo-description">
        Centalion (formerly Gunvor) is one of the world’s largest independent commodities trading companies, creating logistics solutions that safely and efficiently move physical energy, power, metals and minerals from where they are sourced and stored to where they are demanded most. 
      </div>
      <div class="promo-cta">
        <a href="/fia/articles/fia-new-member-centalion" class="button btn-sm">CONTINUE READING</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</li>
          <li class="col-lg-6">
        

<div class="field-content">
  <div class="promo-block half-promo ">
    <div class="promo-content">
              <span class="meta-data darker-gray-color">21 Sep 2026 </span>
            <h4>FIA New Member – Rothera </h4>
            <div class="promo-description">
        Rothera is a US-based, CFTC-regulated designated contract market and clearinghouse. Designed for institutions and intermediaries, Rothera provides un-conflicted trading and clearing infrastructure for futures commission merchants, introducing brokers, and market makers, with a focus on professional, reliable operations, robust controls and responsible market growth.
      </div>
      <div class="promo-cta">
        <a href="/fia/articles/fia-new-member-rothera" class="button btn-sm">CONTINUE READING</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</li>
          <li class="col-lg-6">
        

<div class="field-content">
  <div class="promo-block half-promo ">
    <div class="promo-content">
              <span class="meta-data darker-gray-color">10 Sep 2026 </span>
            <h4>FIA New Member – DLA Piper</h4>
            <div class="promo-description">
        DLA Piper&#039;s global derivatives practice advises clients across the financial markets ecosystem, including financial institutions, exchanges, clearing houses, asset managers, corporates and other market participants. The team delivers strategic advice on complex transactional, documentation and regulatory issues relating to both exchange-traded and over-the-counter derivatives. 
      </div>
      <div class="promo-cta">
        <a href="/fia/articles/fia-new-member-dla-piper" class="button btn-sm">CONTINUE READING</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</li>
          <li class="col-lg-6">
        

<div class="field-content">
  <div class="promo-block half-promo ">
    <div class="promo-content">
              <span class="meta-data darker-gray-color">27 Aug 2026 </span>
            <h4>FIA New Member – DraftKings Predictions</h4>
            <div class="promo-description">
        DraftKings Predictions is a US futures commission merchant and member of the National Futures Association. Part of the DraftKings group, DraftKings Predictions provides customers with access to prediction markets and event contracts. The company plans to operate as the FCM for DKeX, DraftKings&#039; designated contract market, as well as other CFTC-registered exchanges.
      </div>
      <div class="promo-cta">
        <a href="/fia/articles/fia-new-member-draftkings-predictions" class="button btn-sm">CONTINUE READING</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</li>
          <li class="col-lg-6">
        

<div class="field-content">
  <div class="promo-block half-promo ">
    <div class="promo-content">
              <span class="meta-data darker-gray-color">25 Aug 2026 </span>
            <h4>FIA New Member – Supermicro</h4>
            <div class="promo-description">
        Supermicro is a provider of high-performance compute, storage systems, networking and liquid cooling, as well as data centre infrastructure, software and services for enterprise, cloud computing and artificial intelligence applications. Clients include major market infrastructure providers, proprietary trading firms and global banks.
      </div>
      <div class="promo-cta">
        <a href="/fia/articles/fia-new-member-supermicro" class="button btn-sm">CONTINUE READING</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</li>
          <li class="col-lg-6">
        

<div class="field-content">
  <div class="promo-block half-promo ">
    <div class="promo-content">
              <span class="meta-data darker-gray-color">24 Aug 2026 </span>
            <h4>FIA New Member – Chimayo Consulting LLC </h4>
            <div class="promo-description">
        Chimayo Consulting provides advisory services to financial institutions and commodity firms, including FCMs, broker-dealers, swap dealers and other derivatives market participants. Its areas of focus include AI governance, model risk management, operational risk and regulatory compliance. 
      </div>
      <div class="promo-cta">
        <a href="/fia/articles/fia-new-member-chimayo-consulting-llc" class="button btn-sm">CONTINUE READING</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</li>
    
  </ul>

</div>

    </div>
  
          </div>
</div>


                <div class="show-item-list">
            <button class="btn-icon btn-icon-dark">See More</button>
          </div>
      
  
</div>
</div>
